Query:
-- 2)  Confirm the canonical Targetome drug-name that maps to the “sorafenib” drugID’s we just saw.
SELECT DISTINCT  i."drugID",
                 i."drugName"
FROM   TARGETOME_REACTOME.TARGETOME_VERSIONED."INTERACTIONS_V1" i
WHERE  i."drugID" IN ( SELECT DISTINCT d."drugID"
                       FROM TARGETOME_REACTOME.TARGETOME_VERSIONED."DRUG_SYNONYMS_V1" d
                       WHERE d."synonym" ILIKE '%sorafenib%' )
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
drugID,drugName
